[22.797486, "o", "2. Configure ACLs on /srv/shared:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[22.79767, "o", "   - Group \"research\": full rwx permissions (both current and default)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    - Users \"alice\" and \"bob\": full rwx permissions (both current and default)  \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    - Others: no permissions (both current and default)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[22.7978, "o", "\u001b[?2004h>    - Set proper mask to allow full permissions\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> 3. The ACL configuration must ensure that:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
